{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch rockets into orbit around planets, find a good trajectory, and take risks to increase your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to launch your rocket from the portal. Once in the air, it will rotate thanks to the planets' gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the best trajectory to stay in orbit for as long as possible, getting close to the three planets without crashing to score the most points within the allotted time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play solo, multiplayer, and even on Twitch directly with your viewers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more to come!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601890?t=1759583011","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601890?t=1759583011","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601890/79a2e324deca65a10e6e1efd3ef56af3ab8d9d2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759583011","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601890/79a2e324deca65a10e6e1efd3ef56af3ab8d9d2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759583011","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3666620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch rockets into orbit around planets, find a good trajectory, and take risks to increase your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to launch y